{
  "name": "@veriguard/scam-detect",
  "version": "0.12.1",
  "description": "Rule-based scam, phishing and impersonation detection. Runs offline — no API key, no model, nothing sent anywhere.",
  "keywords": [
    "scam",
    "phishing",
    "fraud-detection",
    "smishing",
    "url-analysis",
    "email-security",
    "offline"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "author": "Aleks Linde",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/alekslinde/veriguard/tree/main/packages/engine#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/alekslinde/veriguard.git",
    "directory": "packages/engine"
  },
  "bugs": "https://github.com/alekslinde/veriguard/issues",
  "type": "module",
  "sideEffects": false,
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "//exports": [
    "Every subpath resolves two ways, and the order of conditions is the whole",
    "mechanism:",
    "",
    "  development → ./src/*.ts   the workspace: app, extension, vitest, tsc",
    "  default     → ./dist/*.js  what a consumer installing this gets",
    "",
    "Vite and Vitest apply the `development` condition in dev by default, so a",
    "test run and `next dev` load TypeScript source with no build step between",
    "an edit and a result — the loop this package has always had.",
    "",
    "This is NOT done with publishConfig.exports, which reads as the obvious",
    "tool for it. npm only applies that from v11; under npm 10 it is silently",
    "ignored, and the tarball ships `exports` pointing at ./src/*.ts while",
    "`files` omits src — an install that resolves to nothing. Verified against",
    "the npm in use rather than assumed. A condition map is applied by the",
    "resolver instead of the publisher, so it cannot depend on a client version.",
    "",
    "`types` must precede `default` within each entry; TypeScript takes the",
    "first match and ignores a later `types`."
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "development": "./src/index.ts",
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./detectType": {
      "development": "./src/detectType.ts",
      "types": "./dist/detectType.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/detectType.js"
    },
    "./emailHeaders": {
      "development": "./src/emailHeaders.ts",
      "types": "./dist/emailHeaders.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/emailHeaders.js"
    },
    "./engineTypes": {
      "development": "./src/engineTypes.ts",
      "types": "./dist/engineTypes.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/engineTypes.js"
    },
    "./hostHash": {
      "development": "./src/hostHash.ts",
      "types": "./dist/hostHash.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/hostHash.js"
    },
    "./keyboardAdjacency": {
      "development": "./src/keyboardAdjacency.ts",
      "types": "./dist/keyboardAdjacency.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/keyboardAdjacency.js"
    },
    "./phoneIntel": {
      "development": "./src/phoneIntel.ts",
      "types": "./dist/phoneIntel.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/phoneIntel.js"
    },
    "./publicSuffix": {
      "development": "./src/publicSuffix.ts",
      "types": "./dist/publicSuffix.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/publicSuffix.js"
    },
    "./regions": {
      "development": "./src/regions/index.ts",
      "types": "./dist/regions/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/regions/index.js"
    },
    "./regions/*": {
      "development": "./src/regions/*.ts",
      "types": "./dist/regions/*.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/regions/*.js"
    },
    "./scamDetector": {
      "development": "./src/scamDetector.ts",
      "types": "./dist/scamDetector.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/scamDetector.js"
    },
    "./urlExpander": {
      "development": "./src/urlExpander.ts",
      "types": "./dist/urlExpander.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/urlExpander.js"
    },
    "./urlSanitizer": {
      "development": "./src/urlSanitizer.ts",
      "types": "./dist/urlSanitizer.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/urlSanitizer.js"
    },
    "./verdictRank": {
      "development": "./src/verdictRank.ts",
      "types": "./dist/verdictRank.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/verdictRank.js"
    }
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "provenance": true
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "npm run build:js && npm run build:types",
    "build:js": "tsup",
    "build:types": "tsc -p tsconfig.build.json --emitDeclarationOnly",
    "prepublishOnly": "npm run build"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "libphonenumber-js": "^1.13.14"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "tsup": "^8.5.0",
    "typescript": "^5"
  }
}
